  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added geometry-preserving Boolean, integer, and floating-point spatial hex maps and conversions between spatial and topology-only specialized maps. Expanded numeric maps with element-wise, scalar, mixed integer/floating-point, and spatial/non-spatial arithmetic, remainder, negation, comparison-mask, clamping, and range-rescaling operations. Added Boolean-map morphology, outlines, flood fill, connected components, and distance transforms. Added sextuplet and partial-sextuplet containers with presence flags and layout-aware six-neighbor map sampling. Migration note: the minimum Akeldov.Math.Spatial2D dependency is now 1.0.0, with compatible 1.x releases accepted; contour integration was updated for its 1.0 contracts. Expanded public API and test coverage.",
